Allows you to add any GenericEntityElement and updates its position based on the locators transform. Locator locator = holder.getLocator("<locator_name>");
GenericEntityElement element = new GenericEntityElement() { @Override protected EntityType<? extends Entity> getEntityType() { return EntityType.COW; }
}; // Adds listener for our simple cow element.
locator.addListener(new ElementUpdateListener(element)); // Adds the element to the holder and sends it to nearby clients.
holder.addElement(element);

